{"articleNo":"542062","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=542062&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2025년 대학일자리플러스센터 정책 체감도 및 만족도 조사","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.11.03","hit":"4769","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">고용노동부와 한국고용정보원에서는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">‘2025</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">년 대학일자리플러스센터 정책 체감도 및 만족도 조사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">를 실시하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">본 조사는 대학일자리플러스사업 서비스 수혜자의 만족도 조사를 통해 서비스 질 향상을 위한 목적으로 실시하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>조사대상</b></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:25.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">대학교일자리플러스센터 서비스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">상담</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">취업알선</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">비교과 프로그램 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">를&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">이용한 경험이 있는 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 25pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">졸업생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">지역청년 포함(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">의대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">치대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수의대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">약대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">한의대 제외)</span></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">조사기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 2025. 11. 3 ~ 11. 16</span></p></li></ul><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">조사내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">대학교일자리플러스센터에서 제공하는 서비스의 만족도</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">설문 참여는 소지하고 계신 모바일 기기 또는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">PC</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">를 활용하여&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">아래 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">URL </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">접속 후 참여 가능하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, QR</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">코드를 통해서도 참여 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">조사&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">URL:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://unijob.kr/s1/s3.asp?ACCESS_KEY=Z2R8H&amp;UNIID=U030\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">https://unijob.kr/s1/s3.asp?ACCESS_KEY=Z2R8H&amp;UNIID=U030</a></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">조사는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">분 이내로 소요되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">조사에 참여해 주시는 분들께는 감사의 뜻으로&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">추첨을 통해 경품을 제공하고 있사오니 많은 참여 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"7276\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 1,\n\"dv\": 0,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.1\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"11, 0, 0, 8808\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\